  "sourceTitle": "Baked Split Banana",
  "sourceText": "Baked Split Banana\nBy: The Royal Kitchen\nPublished: Sunday, June 27, 2010 - 5:24am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 ripe banana\n1/2 teaspoon light brown sugar\ncinnamon for dusting\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Preheat the oven to 180 C. 2 Split the banana in half, lengthwise. 3 Sprinkle with sugar. 4 Bake in the oven for 10 minutes. 5 Dust with cinnamon and serve.",
